From: Kunstbanause <3209654+Kunstbanause@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:27:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] d/rift_s: Drive controller poses from the IMU + optical
 fusion filter

- Map controller IMU timestamps into the monotonic clock with a
  windowed min-skew estimator (as the WMR controllers do) and feed the
  fusion filter, resetting it on clock discontinuities.
- Feed optical constellation poses into the filter; the 3DoF yaw nudge
  is skipped once the filter drives the pose.
- Answer pose queries (including the constellation tracker's prior
  lookups at frame time) from the filter's prediction / history.
- RIFT_S_CTRL_FUSION=0 restores the previous behaviour,
  RIFT_S_CTRL_RECORD=<dir> records IMU samples and optical poses as CSV.
- Debug UI: live filter parameters and statistics.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
